    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061102.0174\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 2 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nVice president of DR Congo arrives in Beijing\n\n\n\n\nVice President of Democratic Republic of Congo Abdoulaye Yerodia Ndombasi arrived here Thursday evening for the Beijing Summit of the Forum on China-Africa Cooperation.\n\nForty eight African countries that have diplomatic relations with China are to participate in the two-day summit scheduled to start on Nov. 4.",
